Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.29,0:00:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otaku! Otaku!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.17,0:00:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are all of these people Otaku?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.50,0:00:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so comforting to know all of\Nthese people are our otaku allies.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.83,0:00:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Somehow, it feels like coming home.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are they so relaxed?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.21,0:02:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,These lines are so orderly!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.17,0:02:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The attendees and staff are trained to do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.04,0:02:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why despite the crowds,\Neverything is neat and organized.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is everyone okay with\Nstanding in this heat, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're not, but we came prepared.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.00,0:02:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Warm water bottles! Cold water bottles!\NSalt candy! Portable fans!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.88,0:02:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And a hat for whoever forgot one!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're seriously decked out. Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.42,0:02:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, can I have a hat?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What happened to the one you were wearing?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.13,0:02:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've heard of guys who\Nthink they can climb Mt. Fuji
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,with no gear and collapse halfway up,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,but otaku know their physical limits all too well.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And don't take it from me,\Njust look over there.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure here's just here to buy manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.33,0:02:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know this guy...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why, if it isn't milord Okumura!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, great to see you guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.88,0:02:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogino-san! Magino-san!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.71,0:02:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were coming for Day 1!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.79,0:02:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm selling my cosroms on Day 3,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.83,0:03:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't resist the\Nurge to come see everything!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.17,0:03:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you remember all your gear today?\NKeep a close eye on your stuff, girl!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.92,0:03:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm good today!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.83,0:03:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm good today!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.83,0:03:07.67,Q6,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's definitely a story there...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.67,0:03:08.83,Q6,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's definitely a story there...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.42,0:03:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard through the grapevine that\Nthe four of you are cosplaying together.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've created quite the buzz.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.96,0:03:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you perchance get me\Nan autograph from Mikarin?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.67,0:03:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you kept up\Nwith regular pop culture, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.79,0:03:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And, just in time for Comiket,\Nthe last of the Rising Stars were posted yesterday!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I haven't seen it yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.79,0:03:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be better prepared, milord!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You may have countless rivals in the world of cosplay,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.63,0:03:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,and though the Four Heavenly Queens\Nare among them,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,their main target are their passionate fans.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.42,0:03:43.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd say no matter how hard we try,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,we won't be able to attract\Nany part of their audience.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.25,0:03:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our target audience should be the wandering\Nphotographers looking for cute cosplayers!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.96,0:03:55.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That would make the other relative\Nnewbies our toughest competition!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.71,0:03:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.\NSo, who's next on the ranking?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.67,0:04:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, right!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.54,0:04:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're coming to Day 1, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ranking #2 and #3!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.46,0:04:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers and real-life twins Lemon and Lime!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.08,0:04:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,These one-in-a-million twin cosplayers and\Ntheir high-quality costumes are the next big thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, the next two in the ranking are twins?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.92,0:04:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And twins are in particularly high demand right now...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're cosplaying the twin\Nmaids Shiro and Kuro,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,characters that are all the rage right now!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they literally just announced Season 2!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to see them!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop being otaku! They're our competition!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,West Hall attendee line is moving!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,West Hall attendee line is moving!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.50,Q6,,0,0,0,,Oh! The line is moving!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.50,0:04:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is that going to affect us?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet actual twins cosplaying\NShiro and Kuro will draw a huge crowd...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.96,0:04:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, word of them is gonna spread like wildfire...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.71,0:04:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we just need Aria's dad to\Nsee our pictures, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.46,0:04:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right, but unless he keeps\Nup with all the cosplay news,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,he's not gonna hear about us\Nunless we're one of the most popular posts.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.17,0:05:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, Aria can only be here today and tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.75,0:05:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll do what we can to draw our own crowds\Nand get tons of pictures taken and posted online!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.67,0:05:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Too bad we couldn't get this done before Obon...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay! It's like this every year for Obon.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.50,0:05:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but weren't you gonna go to\NComiket to see that Squadron cosplay group?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, is that right, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.38,0:05:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not quite. I said I might go...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.29,0:05:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.46,0:05:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're posting pics of all the\Ncute cosplayers in real time.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.75,0:05:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,If they come across while I'm scrolling,\NI'll let you know!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.92,0:05:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are all these girls cosplayers?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.71,0:05:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So many people...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.67,0:05:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is our first time at Comiket, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.92,0:05:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is crazy...\NWe're supposed to outshine everyone here?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That means everyone here is competition!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-no, they're our friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.79,0:05:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but we want to be number one, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.25,0:05:57.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.83,0:05:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, they can be both!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.50,0:06:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Athletes are friendly with one another,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,but everyone wants to\Nbeat the other teams, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can just pretend we're on a sports team!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.42,0:06:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,A sports team?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.42,0:06:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know you're otaku,\Nbut you have to know what sports are, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not here... Oh, no...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.79,0:06:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.63,0:06:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you need a wig cap? Here! I brought extras.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.17,0:06:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.13,0:06:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria's right. Everyone here is our friend...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.67,0:06:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...but today, we're going to crush them all!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.75,0:06:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai! Sorry about the wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.67,0:07:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes! He's never lost this much blood before!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.71,0:07:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's how you're measuring it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's redder than a tomato.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.63,0:07:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai's blushing!\NI've dreamed of getting this reaction out of him!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you all have your weapons this time!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.50,0:07:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Comiket allows long props,\Nso I worked hard to get them ready in time!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.75,0:07:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow... I can't believe all four\NSquadron members are here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.63,0:07:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the best Liliel cosplay I've ever seen.\NIt's perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, what about me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.54,0:07:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the best Miriella I've ever seen!\NSame goes for Nokiel and Ariel!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.42,0:07:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already feel like we're drawing a lot of attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.75,0:07:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's because your costumes are so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's making me nervous...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ririsa?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.75,0:08:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know I've never asked this of you before, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do this for me today.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.83,0:08:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Ashford Chronicles manga ended\Non a hot summer day like today.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.46,0:08:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The last chapter?! So no more Liliel?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.13,0:08:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how I'd keep on living after that.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.29,0:08:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel saved my life, and now she was gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.63,0:08:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I lived for those Monday magazines.\NWhat was I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.00,0:08:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you're not an otaku,\Nyou might think I'm exaggerating.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.38,0:08:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really felt that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.29,0:08:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Liliel: Side Story manga\Nrescued me from the pits of despair.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.38,0:08:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's what's kept me alive to this day.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.67,0:08:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The manga my dad created...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.88,0:09:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, please... Do this for me today!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.88,0:09:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dazzle everyone with your perfect cosplay,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.63,0:09:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and show Kisaki-sensei\Nhow much we love him!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.92,0:09:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.33,0:09:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, hands in!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.04,0:09:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.42,0:09:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,L-Liliel...?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,...explosion?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.13,0:09:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, we have to go, Sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.33,0:09:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! I need to admire them more before\Nthey're swarmed by photographers!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.42,0:09:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There you are, Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kai-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.67,0:09:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're doing Racing Mika!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As an official booth girl, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.21,0:09:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And hey, not recognizing me just\Nmeans my cosplay is that good.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.71,0:10:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see you're not cosplaying, Mayura...\NThough you did doll yourself up.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.42,0:10:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a special occasion.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today was gonna be the year I crushed you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't need me as a rival anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got my apprentice!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.71,0:10:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.\NThere are tons of Liliel-tier cosplayers here today.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.75,0:10:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kuro-chan from Hellmaids!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.00,0:10:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got pigtails today!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.29,0:10:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even from this far away,\NI can see how good their costume is.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.13,0:10:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, could that be one of\Nthe twins from the ranking?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.33,0:10:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemon... Or Lime. I can't tell them apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.38,0:10:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lime!\NWhy are you taking so long?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.96,0:10:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's really hard doing this by myself...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.58,0:10:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'm missing part of my costume.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.21,0:10:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What, seriously?! Did you forget it at home?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.08,0:10:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I think you put it in your bag...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,E-excuse me, could you help me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.17,0:11:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Uh, okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.25,0:11:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,My partner needs help in the changing room.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.54,0:11:15.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you bring this to them?\NJust this, that's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.96,0:11:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We look the same and are wearing the same outfit!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.33,0:11:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why doesn't she just do it herself?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why doesn't she just do it herself?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.54,0:11:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I was actually asking the guy behind you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.58,0:11:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.79,0:11:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... Lemon sent you to help?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.88,0:11:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.71,0:11:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, could you zip me up in the back?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.63,0:11:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here... If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.63,0:12:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does this feel super inappropriate?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so, so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,As you might've guessed, I'm Lemon...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.13,0:12:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'm Lime.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help today!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.42,0:12:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! I'm Liliel, by the way!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.79,0:12:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then they must be Nonoa-chan and Mikarin!\NThat's so cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.63,0:12:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.75,0:12:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to deal with this.\NI hope you're not grossed out.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.25,0:12:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean... S-some people think guys\Nwho crossdress for cosplay are gross.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.08,0:12:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.54,0:12:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're adorable! Your cosplay is perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.13,0:12:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the living embodiment of Shiro!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're too sweet.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.83,0:13:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, does gender not matter\Nto you as long as they're 2D?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great, now my competition just doubled!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.88,0:13:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your costumes are amazing!\NThe attention to detail is bonkers!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right?! I got it commissioned,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.38,0:13:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I kept bugging them\Nuntil they got everything just right!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made sure they used leather for this part\Nto match the shine we see in the anime,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.63,0:13:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that the patterns were\Nembroidered instead of just printed on!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.21,0:13:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you did!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you did!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.88,0:13:21.50,Q6,,0,0,0,,They didn't make their costumes themselves,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks so much more accurate!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.50,0:13:23.13,Q6,,0,0,0,,They didn't make their costumes themselves,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.13,0:13:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what you get with a professional!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.13,0:13:26.42,Q6,,0,0,0,,but still want to make sure they're accurate...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.79,0:13:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No wonder they look so good.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.58,0:13:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since we're twins, we always watch\Nthe same anime and like the same stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.96,0:13:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And whenever we see twins, we get super attached.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.71,0:13:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're downright obsessed with Shiro and Kuro!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why this is our best cosplay yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.08,0:13:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, we've gotta go.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.21,0:13:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's show 'em why the four of us ranked on that list!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.38,0:13:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,See you out there!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.58,0:14:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,All the new cosplayers are so nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.79,0:14:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're just as talented as Nagomi,\Nbut without any of her drama-mongering.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm literally right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.67,0:14:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be tough.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Between their passion and attention to detail,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,plus the cute twin thing\Nthey've got going for them...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.92,0:14:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And they're doing one of the\Nmost popular cosplays out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.29,0:14:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're gonna kill it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.17,0:14:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly, they're a bigger threat to me than Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.08,0:14:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even someone as huge as\NNagomi is worried about them...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.21,0:14:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it realistic for us to try and beat everyone here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.92,0:14:49.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we still have to try our best, for Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan, you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.38,0:14:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.88,0:14:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we keep wasting time,\Nwe'll lose out on all the good spots!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.71,0:15:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's head out!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.00,0:15:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Swimsuit and skimpier cosplays aren't\Nallowed at the entrance or garden cosplay areas.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.42,0:15:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's 'cause normal people not\Nattending Comiket might see them.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.71,0:15:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.96,0:15:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're not showing too much skin,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,but Aria-chan's bottoms are kinda toeing the line,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.88,0:15:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so just to be safe,\Nwe'll go to the rooftop area!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.63,0:15:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew Comiket was big, but damn.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize there'd be this many cosplayers.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.50,0:15:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm used to being the center of attention,\Nbut this is like... Stifling? It's crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.04,0:15:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even for you, Mikarin?\NDamn, now I'm getting nervous.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.75,0:15:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you've been through this, Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been here out of cosplay before...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.96,0:16:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but being in the middle all\Nof this is totally nerve-wracking.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.67,0:16:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Shiro and Kuro from Hellmaids!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemon and Lime!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.33,0:16:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.67,0:16:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've seen tons of Hellmaids today,\Nbut I gotta get pictures of Lemon-Lime!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're on a whole 'nother level...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.17,0:16:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of embarrassed to be here.\NLet's find another place to stand...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.38,0:16:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to find our spot!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.67,0:16:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Already?! But I'm not mentally prepared yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.33,0:16:32.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, be brave!\NThere's no room for cowards up here!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I swore I'd become a top cosplayer...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.67,0:16:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I made such a fuss about it,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.88,0:16:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it's gonna be so\Nmuch harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.42,0:16:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm like, freaking out...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.83,0:16:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.58,0:16:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should've known.\NI assumed cosplay would be easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.42,0:16:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed,\NI just want to go home.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.71,0:17:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on! We're waiting on you!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.71,0:17:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa... Mikarin...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.13,0:17:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She looks a whole lot like me,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If my dad really is the artist\Ndrawing the Liliel spin-off manga...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.13,0:17:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Ariel is his original character...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.54,0:17:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want my dad to see me cosplaying her!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mikarin?! Is that really her?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that Ariel is super cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.71,0:17:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This group is insane!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.96,0:17:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're ready for photos!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.75,0:18:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looking amazing, Mikarin!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.75,0:18:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan, smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.00,0:18:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is good, right?\NWe're starting with a huge crowd.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please. This is where the real challenge starts.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is where Summer Comiket comes for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.92,0:18:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Any updates, Mita-kun?\NSee that Liliel group yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're more excited to see it than our Sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.04,0:18:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.33,0:18:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy putting screentones on her every week!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.46,0:18:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That basically makes her our baby, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.88,0:18:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,See how much we love our Liliel, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.08,0:18:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, updates!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been about two hours since the event started,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen any pictures of them yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen any pictures of them yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.29,Q6,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.50,0:19:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.21,0:19:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's taking pictures of our group,\Nbut the crowd isn't getting any bigger.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be easier for her, but guess not.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Sensei?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.25,0:19:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mentioned this before,\Nbut Comiket attendees are always on the move.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.75,0:19:23.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's trying to make the most of their time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The venue is huge,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.04,Q10,,0,0,0,,Did you get Mikarin?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,and one day's not enough to get
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.71,Q10,,0,0,0,,Yup! C'mon, who's next?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,pictures of everyone and buy stuff, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.71,0:19:27.63,Q10,,0,0,0,,Yup! C'mon, who's next?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.63,0:19:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,pictures of everyone and buy stuff, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.67,0:19:31.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin's drawn a big crowd,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,but those people will leave as\Nsoon as they get their picture.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, though!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.08,0:19:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about them?\NTheir crowd keeps getting bigger!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're doing popular characters,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.67,0:19:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but their quality and level of\Nfame is basically on our level.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.54,0:19:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, Mikarin alone makes us way more famous, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.67,0:19:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.67,0:19:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you get Nonoa and Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.83,0:19:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I tried, but I couldn't get\Nany good pictures, so I gave up.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.46,0:20:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Lemon-Lime's gonna look better.\NMr. Camera knows his stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good pictures? Wait a sec...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.33,0:20:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, milord!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are your girls faring?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.13,0:20:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good, but our crowd isn't getting any bigger.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.33,0:20:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They seem a bit disorganized.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.46,0:20:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is one of the troubles with larger cosplay groups.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more people there,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.88,0:20:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,the more difficult it is to coordinate\Nposes and gazes to get a good photo.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.50,0:20:35.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,T'would seem they're only\Nperforming two or three poses here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.42,0:20:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right, they keep doing the same poses!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.17,0:20:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Liliel's strength is her infinite number of poses,\Nbut her groupmates can't match that.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.25,0:20:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are so many four-person poses I'd want to do,\Nif I could just get us to do them!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.88,0:20:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why you're seeing less poses from their group.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.54,0:20:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That means people will take only\Na few photos before finishing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mismatched gazes and a mistimed
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,blink can ruin a photo, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.88,0:21:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photographers want to be able to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,share their photos with everyone,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.33,0:21:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they can't do that if the photo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.33,0:21:07.46,Q10,,0,0,0,,I can't upload this.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.46,0:21:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they can't do that if the photo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.04,0:21:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they can't do that if the photo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.04,0:21:08.79,Q10,,0,0,0,,None of mine came out good.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,doesn't come out to their liking.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.00,Q10,,0,0,0,,None of mine came out good.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.00,0:21:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,doesn't come out to their liking.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.00,0:21:10.96,Q10,,0,0,0,,I'll put up the Mikarin solo shot.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.96,0:21:11.96,Q14,,0,0,0,,I'll put up the Mikarin solo shot.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.96,0:21:13.08,Q14,,0,0,0,,Let's head out.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.67,0:21:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel draws an ever-increasing\Ncrowd with her plethora of poses,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.88,0:21:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but here, with her group, she can't use
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,any of her strengths\Nto their collective advantage.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.29,0:21:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The twins, however, are highly coordinated,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.67,0:21:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The twins, however, are highly coordinated,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.67,0:21:28.50,Q10,,0,0,0,,I keep getting great photos of them!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.50,0:21:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The twins, however, are highly coordinated,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.50,0:21:30.13,Q14,,0,0,0,,I waited in line forever. Gonna make this count!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,and are exhibiting many different poses.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.13,0:21:31.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,I waited in line forever. Gonna make this count!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,and are exhibiting many different poses.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.63,0:21:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And to make matters worse,\Nthey're about to deal with the greatest challenge of all...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.92,0:21:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Water break!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.54,0:21:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry everyone, we're taking a quick break!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry everyone, we're taking a quick break!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.96,Q6,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, break time?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.17,0:21:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Choose your next move carefully.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.04,0:21:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like my head's melting underneath this wig!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We definitely can't take them off now...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa, your makeup is smudged.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.79,0:22:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.79,0:22:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,At Summer Comiket,\Nbreaks like these are a necessity.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.08,0:22:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, breaks mean you lose your captive audience.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.92,0:22:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't keep going like this...
